{"id":1177,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为构建家校协同育人长效机制，凝聚育人共识、汇聚教育合力，近日，信息与通信工程学院（人工智能学院）2026 级新生家长见面会在瑾瑜国际会议中心举行。学院院长王黎明教授，党委副书记兼副院长么兰，教学副院长陈友兴教授，科研副院长刘吉教授，学院团委书记闫婷及2026级全体班主任出席会议，与远道而来的新生家长齐聚一堂，共话成长未来。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM8LSsLN7sLRUiUz8Q7MlW7M7UDM4llDLzUPMl-8nNU4Lm70gihFp2hmCIa0LShfokyYUSy4MmvaUmlsMmGsnmGiMmWVM4NZnmNYMmU8LNQFMz6VUzGinNWFLN7bMmLJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1A82A3670B57607F0562E798F926442F/57EA05FB/2A963\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM8LSsLN7sLRUiUz8Q7MlW7M7UDM4llDLzUPMl-8nNU4Lm70gihFp2hmCIa0LShfokyYUSy4MmvaUmlsMmGsnmGiMmWVM4NZnmNYMmU8LNQFMz6VUzGinNWFLN7bMmLJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nLRQS7MzrfnNMfMzR7YM46RU4N4nzvlbnRCYnlL4UN-4MN-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7LkyPMSyaolUDM467MlV7nRlbozQ2U47YU8L8M7LiM4WFoRffM47aUzTFLNQRUm-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1D01509D677D5ADD5996FC12CC44C572/80A710A9/2FCB2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nLRQS7MzrfnNMfMzR7YM46RU4N4nzvlbnRCYnlL4UN-4MN-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh7LkyPMSyaolUDM467MlV7nRlbozQ2U47YU8L8M7LiM4WFoRffM47aUzTFLNQRUm-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\"></p><p>王黎明院长代表学院全体师生向各位家长的到来表示欢迎与感谢。他指出，家长把孩子托付给学院是一份沉甸甸的信任。依托中北大学 “人民兵工第一校” 红色底蕴，学院拥有本科到博士后完整培养体系、国家级和省级一流专业平台，面向本科生开放科创资源，师资力量雄厚，能够全力护航学生成长。期待家校同心，帮助新生扣好大学 “第一粒扣子”。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM8CS4nzN4o778LzR-8ozVVUlL4nl7lZnzMkLRUDMzQVLRL0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyZMYhVMkhVoR9in7MVoRvbUNlPolVkLRNPUNUDMRAfnmnFL47snN-DMNrFM7V2nz7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D87E4E885DCE879BE19AB091BD648AF4/317FB66E/4AFE1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM4TS2M4Q7oRVkMzNQ2U4L8Ll7sM4ll8UN7ZoR7ZUzGiMzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDUSh2L1ysM4Q7L4AfoRCPozTVL4W2LRLPnzCbL4nVM8nFU4Afn7WVnNMFL4LsnNQ2gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvsoSbw62r8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\"></p><p>么兰副书记详细介绍了学院的基本情况、学风建设工作举措、升学就业情况及学生成长支持体系。她表示，学院将畅通家校沟通渠道，与家长同心携手护航学生成长。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL7MSVozWknRNPMzlUPoRGio7UPUmGlanlLDLz-ZM8lYLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7LSybM1ybnmL8M7l4UzNYUzARMN-ioRrkLNUYU4V2MmMFL4-aoR9ao7VFMRW7nl-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7D1969F344E3A92A8C6B585B2D2C1F63/3208808A/42DEB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL7MSVozWknRNPMzlUPoRGio7UPUmGlanlLDLz-ZM8lYLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7LSybM1ybnmL8M7l4UzNYUzARMN-ioRrkLNUYU4V2MmMFL4-aoR9ao7VFMRW7nl-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg\"></p><p>见面会结束后，各班班主任与到场家长展开面对面深入交流。围绕班级日常管理、学业适应规划、校园生活保障等家长关切的具体问题，班主任们逐一细致解答，耐心回应每位家长的疑问与建议，在近距离沟通中进一步拉近家校距离、凝聚育人共识。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nL7WSRMl7sLlVRUzzviLNCZUzrRUlClPozvbUNWfUm6VoRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyiLkyPMky8nmQ2L8UsMz6RLm-DL7UDnR-anlMVMmL4UlnFUlUbL7QkUlrFM4vbnRNJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D50144F6F3D757C2260D6D20ECE633AD/AD90FBAE/779D9\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM7USso7MVU4NiUzz-PUm9sL4vbLzGlYLmC8n7nknmrVMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nky4U1ybMShRnznVMN7so7MRLRlYLmC8Mz7aM4CsnNliMNMFUmrVL4M2nRVFLz67UzA7gjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvsoSbw62r8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=noRGSaL4GbMlr2nzz9PUNMVM4lsLmUlsUmNsoRUsoz-iLmN0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZU1hVU1h7nzQfMzlPUlCiozWfUm-sLzrVU4NaMmNiLNMFnNrVo7V7oR6FUNW7UlCJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E8BEBDE6A551AF592AB2715EC906952C/FEE8AD87/BBDAF\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nnlUS4oRvZMR-bMzRUYo7VVnmviM8ClYMRQRUm9bo7r2MN70gihFp2hmCIa0U1hknSh7n1hfnm62U87iMm9anmTkUzvDM8M7nmTVnzCinmMFozlanRLPU4WFLmUPMRTRgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoRvsoSbw62r8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.png\"></p><p>本次家长见面会搭建起家校沟通的坚实桥梁，增进了家长对学院办学工作的信任与认同。下一步，学院将持续畅通家校沟通渠道，健全协同育人机制，与家长同心携手，共同陪伴2026级新生成长成才、逐梦前行。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=nM8LSsLN7sLRUiUz8Q7MlW7M7UDM4llDLzUPMl-8nNU4Lm70gihFp2hmCIa0LShfokyYUSy4MmvaUmlsMmGsnmGiMmWVM4NZnmNYMmU8LNQFMz6VUzGinNWFLN7bMmLJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZM4vbgtA8pUrcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18779&e=.jpg"}